fatal: No ADI ToF camera found
tof_net_collect FILE [data_collect-options] [network-options]

This program is built from the examples/data_collect acquisition model.
It always captures raw frames with enableDepthCompute=off, compresses them
losslessly, and sends them to tof_net_viewer. It does not compute depth.

Arguments:
  FILE                         ADI camera initialization JSON, same as data_collect.
                               Example: config/config_crosby_adsd3500_new_modes.json

data_collect-compatible options:
  --ip <ip>                     Camera IP, same spelling as data_collect.
  --m <mode>                    Camera mode number. Default: 0.
  --ft <frame_type>             Accepted for compatibility. Forced to raw in this app.
  --fw <firmware>               Firmware path, same as data_collect.
  --ic <configuration>          Sensor configuration. Default: standard-raw.
  --fps <setfps>                Accepted for compatibility.
  --ccb <FILE>                  Save module CCB to FILE, same as data_collect.
  --ext_fsync <0|1>             Sync mode, same as data_collect.
  --wt <warmup>                 Warmup seconds, same as data_collect.
  --n <ncapture>                Optional max frame count. 0 means stream until StopCapture.

tof_net_collect network/compression options:
  --server-ip <B_IP>            Machine B / tof_net_viewer IP.
  --bind-ip <A_IP>              Bind outbound TCP socket to Machine A IP.
  --port <PORT>                 TCP port. Default: 5000.
  --zstd-level <N>              Zstd compression level. Default: 1.
  --no-reconnect                Exit when the B connection drops.
  -h, --help                    Show this help.
